
                                <p><p>Karbala... Karbala..(4)<br />
Paani pyaaso ko jab pilaoge, karbala waley yaad aaenge..(2)<br />
Paani pyaaso ko jab pilaoge....</p>

<p>1. Koi marjata hai kisi ka agar<br />
kandha dete hai log aake magar<br />
sheh ne tanha uthai laashe pisar<br />
jab jawaa koi laash uthaoge..<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...</p>

<p>2. Karbala mein bana tha jo dulha<br />
kya muqaddar tha uski dulhan ka<br />
shab ko dulhan thi subha ko bewa<br />
betiyo ka jo ghar basaoge<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...</p>

<p>3. Ali asghar ki maa pe nazre thi<br />
ran mein yu teer kha ke roya nahi<br />
maa pareshaan ho na jaye kahin<br />
zakhm khaa kar jo muskuraoge<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...</p>

<p>4. Baap bichhda tha jab sakina se<br />
har qadam par use tamache lage<br />
koi deta na tha tasalli use<br />
jab yateemo pe tars khaaoge<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...</p>

<p>5. Ek beti jahaa&#39;n me hai sughra<br />
qabr tak jiska intezaar gaya<br />
jiska baba na laut kar aaya<br />
ghar mein pardes se jab aaoge<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...</p>

<p>6. Haaye muslim ke wo pisar dono<br />
eid ke din the dar ba darr dono<br />
yaad karte the apna ghar dono<br />
eid apno mein jab manaoge<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...</p>

<p>7. Jab janaza batool ka uttha<br />
sabr us dam ali ka kaisa tha<br />
girya zainab ke saamne na kiya<br />
aansu bacho se jab chhupaoge<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...</p>

<p>8. Aisa dekha nahi ghareeb koi<br />
bus ye ghurbat hai sirf Mahdi ki<br />
qabr e zehra hai abhi tooti hui<br />
qabr pe maa ke jab bhi jaaoge<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...</p>

<p>9. Hai takallum payam e sabr yahi<br />
karbala dil mein gar tumhare rahi<br />
tum pe mushkil padhegi jab bhi koi<br />
apne ghum saare bhool jaoge<br />
karbala waley yaad aaenge...<br />
Paani pyaaso ko jab pilaoge, karbala waley yaad aaenge<br />
Karbala... Karbala..</p>
